{"id":23034,"name":"回到大地的飞行","rarity":5,"path":"Shaman","desc":"同谐命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"虚妄迷想业已碎裂，他要做万物的太阳，却从天空坠落。\\n\\n<i>「感受到了何为痛苦吗？」</i>\\n他心中另一道声音如是说道。\\n<i>「那正是我应感受的。」</i>\\n他落入尘埃，用沉重的脚步回答。\\n\\n他行走于大地，再次看到遍布人世的苦楚，如同源源不断的水泉。\\n他跨越拦路的荆棘，他听闻凡人的呼喊，他经受苦惘，他获得宁静。\\n\\n<i>「坠落，本是飞翔的别名。」</i>\\n在这第八日，他赐予自身「启程」。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23034,"name":"再启程","desc":"当装备者对我方单体角色施放战技或终结技后，装备者恢复<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[f1]</unbreak></color>点能量，同时使技能目标获得1层【圣咏】，持续<unbreak>#4[i]</unbreak>回合，最多叠加<unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak>层，每层【圣咏】使持有者造成的伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>。装备者每对我方单体角色施放<unbreak>#5[i]</unbreak>次战技或终结技后，恢复1个战技点。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[6,0.15,3,3,2]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[6.5,0.1725,3,3,2]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[7,0.195,3,3,2]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[7.5,0.2175,3,3,2]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[8,0.24,3,3,2]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":52.8,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":21.6,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":24,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":114011,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":116.16,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":47.52,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":52.8,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110231,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":114011,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":200.64,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":82.08,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":91.2,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110232,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":114012,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":285.12,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":116.64,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":129.6,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110232,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":114012,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":369.6,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":151.2,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":168,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":100000},{"ItemID":110233,"ItemNum":5},{"ItemID":114013,"